{"3856920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tenfold", "steam_appid": 3856920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter dangerous dungeons filled with deadly enemies, challenging encounters, and powerful bosses. Master a fire mage's arsenal as you combine spells, trigger powerful procs, and unleash devastating attacks to overcome increasingly difficult threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is built around active decision-making and skillful play. Dodge telegraphed enemy attacks, manage your spell rotations, and choose between powerful single-target and area-of-effect abilities depending on the situation. Every encounter rewards good positioning, timing, and awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of enemy types, each with their own attack patterns and mechanics. From relentless melee fighters and ranged attackers to dangerous shamans and powerful bosses, every enemy presents a unique challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore handcrafted dungeons, discover new challenges, and master the art of fire magic in a fast-paced action RPG inspired by MMORPG dungeon combat.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter dangerous dungeons filled with deadly enemies, challenging encounters, and powerful bosses. Master a fire mage's arsenal as you combine spells, trigger powerful procs, and unleash devastating attacks to overcome increasingly difficult threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is built around active decision-making and skillful play. Dodge telegraphed enemy attacks, manage your spell rotations, and choose between powerful single-target and area-of-effect abilities depending on the situation. Every encounter rewards good positioning, timing, and awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of enemy types, each with their own attack patterns and mechanics. From relentless melee fighters and ranged attackers to dangerous shamans and pow